根据原文意图整理的示例：
```text
#include <stdexcept>
#include <iostream>

void throwIf(bool shouldThrow) {
    if (shouldThrow) {
        throw std::runtime_error{"Here's my exception"};
    }
}

int main() {
    try {
        throwIf(false);
        throwIf(true);
    } catch (const std::runtime_error& e) {
        std::cerr << "Caught exception: " << e.what() << std::endl;
    }
}
```
当 throwIf(true) 执行时，控制流离开 try 块并进入匹配的 catch 块。
